      "note": "False positive — `role`/`role_id` from staff_params are never mass-assigned directly. `role_assignment` (same file) re-derives a validated { role:, assigned_role: } hash from them — role_id is looked up via current_company.roles.find (tenant-scoped, raises on a foreign/bogus id) and role only ever reaches the model as one of the enum's own values."
